# Python
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Data. None of it is redistributed through this repo, including the derived
# JSON the site reads - only INE/SERPAVI/Ayuntamiento CC BY-style sources are
# clearly free to redistribute, but several others (Colegio de Registradores
# purchase prices, Idealista asking rent) are not, and the derived files mix
# sources together. Cloning this repo gets you the code only; run the
# pipeline (see README.md) to build your own copy of the data, including
# manually re-fetching a few small source files per the docstrings in
# pipeline/05_purchase.py and pipeline/09_rent_asking.py.
data/raw/*
!data/raw/.gitkeep
data/processed/*
!data/processed/.gitkeep
data/site/*
!data/site/.gitkeep

# Design mockups / reference material - not part of the published project.
design/

# Private project-handoff notes and data-licensing review - not for the public repo.
CLAUDE.md
DATA_SOURCES.md

# Dev-only test harness and its dependency file - kept locally, not published.
tests/
requirements-dev.txt
